Lab 8: Running Playbooks with Automation Controller
Objectives

By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

    Navigate the Automation Controller web interface effectively
    Create and configure job templates in Automation Controller
    Execute job templates and understand their components
    Monitor job execution status and review job outputs
    Troubleshoot common job execution issues
    Understand the relationship between playbooks, inventories, and job templates

Prerequisites

Before starting this lab, you should have:

    Basic understanding of Ansible playbooks and YAML syntax
    Familiarity with Linux command line operations
    Knowledge of SSH key authentication
    Understanding of inventory concepts in Ansible
    Completed previous labs covering Ansible fundamentals
    Access to a web browser for the Automation Controller interface

