Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Job Template Won't Launch

Symptoms: Launch button is grayed out or job fails immediately

Solutions:

    Verify all required fields are filled
    Check that inventory has accessible hosts
    Ensure credentials have proper permissions
    Confirm project sync is successful

Issue 2: Playbook Not Found Error

Symptoms: Job fails with "playbook not found" message

Solutions:

    Verify playbook exists in the project repository
    Check playbook path and filename spelling
    Ensure project synchronization completed successfully
    Confirm playbook is in the correct directory

Issue 3: Authentication Failures

Symptoms: Jobs fail with SSH or permission errors

Solutions:

    Verify credential configuration
    Check SSH key permissions and format
    Ensure target hosts accept the SSH key
    Test manual SSH connection to verify connectivity

Issue 4: Slow Job Execution

Symptoms: Jobs take longer than expected to complete

Solutions:

    Check network connectivity to target hosts
    Review system resources on Automation Controller
    Consider using forks parameter to increase parallelism
    Optimize playbook tasks for better performance

